# Node builds use Cargo.{toml,lock}, crates/, and vendor/.
# Everything else (esp. the 20 GB chiado snapshot + target/) must stay out
# of the build context or `docker build` ships it to the daemon.
.git/
.ci-cargo-state/
**/target/
**/node_modules/
ui/dist/
ui/.runtime/
chiado-db/
data/
datadir/
eez-core-protocol/out/
eez-core-protocol/cache/
contracts/out/
contracts/cache/
contracts/broadcast/
prompts/
explanations/
docs/
*.bak
.env
.env.*
!.env.chiado.example
*.log
